1
00:00:00,002 --> 00:00:01,525
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,527 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,250
(Episode 73)

4
00:00:06,541 --> 00:00:08,000
I'll get going.

5
00:00:09,298 --> 00:00:11,361
You'll fall. I'll call you a cab.

6
00:00:14,698 --> 00:00:17,020
Are you crazy?

7
00:00:17,389 --> 00:00:19,249
Just let her go. Hurry.

8
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:21,416
Mom, calm down.

9
00:00:22,243 --> 00:00:25,077
I'll handle it. Go inside.
It's not what you think.

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,999
Come with me. What are you doing here?

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
- That hurts.
- Stop pretending.

12
00:00:34,627 --> 00:00:36,252
You're all being so cruel.

13
00:00:36,454 --> 00:00:39,454
She came to see me.
Mind your own business.

14
00:00:43,954 --> 00:00:46,228
You can only throw so many stones
at someone.

15
00:00:49,625 --> 00:00:51,375
Ma'am.

16
00:00:52,269 --> 00:00:54,935
Do Do Hee, Director Cha this time?

17
00:00:55,250 --> 00:00:57,416
Can't you stand it
unless you take what's mine?

18
00:00:59,211 --> 00:01:02,336
You like Do Hee? Surely not.

19
00:01:05,423 --> 00:01:08,839
Who I like doesn't matter.
That's none of your business.

20
00:01:08,944 --> 00:01:12,153
And is there nothing else in this world
besides love and revenge?

21
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:22,125
Cha Seung Woo! Hey!

22
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:24,980
That spineless brat!

23
00:01:27,375 --> 00:01:31,500
Ma'am, what do we do?

24
00:01:32,136 --> 00:01:33,381
Why aren't you coming in?

25
00:01:34,039 --> 00:01:37,539
Seung Hyun, go stop Seung Woo. Hurry!

26
00:01:38,250 --> 00:01:40,750
What am I supposed to do with him?

27
00:01:47,375 --> 00:01:52,000
Has he lost his mind?
How could he get mixed up with Do Do Hee?

28
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:54,750
Mom, just stay put.

29
00:01:57,085 --> 00:02:01,876
Seung Hyun, Seung Woo saw what happened
on the rooftop. He knows what she is like.

30
00:02:02,154 --> 00:02:03,863
So how could he do this?

31
00:02:04,007 --> 00:02:07,735
And didn't he say himself
that Ji Ni was his little sister?

32
00:02:08,172 --> 00:02:11,443
After all she put his own sister through,

33
00:02:11,444 --> 00:02:13,675
how can he take her side?
Does that make any sense?

34
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,993
That "Love in Zip" show is the problem.

35
00:02:16,994 --> 00:02:19,125
He got attached to her
while filming that show.

36
00:02:19,875 --> 00:02:22,375
He probably went to Do Hee's place.
I'll go get him.

37
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:25,125
No, I'll go. Give me the address.

38
00:02:25,250 --> 00:02:27,875
Why go after him? Leave him alone.
He can come back on his own.

39
00:02:28,375 --> 00:02:30,916
If he's not home by tonight,
he's no son of mine. That brat!

40
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:34,125
- Yeong Ju.
- Yeong Ju.

41
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:37,719
Text me the address.

42
00:02:59,275 --> 00:03:00,416
I'll do it.

43
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:02,719
Give it to me.

44
00:03:06,617 --> 00:03:07,696
Ji Hu,

45
00:03:09,315 --> 00:03:12,891
are we doomed to keep crossing paths
with Do Do Hee?

46
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,375
I'm really scared.

47
00:03:16,375 --> 00:03:18,539
Why can't I get away from her?

48
00:03:18,693 --> 00:03:20,027
Don't overthink it.

49
00:03:20,886 --> 00:03:22,617
Everyone's blaming Do Hee,

50
00:03:22,905 --> 00:03:26,220
so maybe he thought
someone should be on her side.

51
00:03:28,606 --> 00:03:30,619
We've seen what she's like.

52
00:03:31,666 --> 00:03:33,125
Honestly, I'm a little hurt.

53
00:03:33,876 --> 00:03:37,210
If someone in your family was bullied,
wouldn't you take their side?

54
00:03:39,056 --> 00:03:43,681
I guess I'm still not family to him.

55
00:03:50,125 --> 00:03:51,641
Don't let it hurt you.

56
00:03:51,956 --> 00:03:55,125
I'm sure there was a reason
he acted that way.

57
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,114
Get some rest.

58
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:12,416
Can't we eat first?
I'm hungry. I haven't eaten all day.

59
00:04:15,595 --> 00:04:19,220
Stop giving me a hard time.
You and I are on opposite sides.

60
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:22,541
I'm on Ji Ni's side, remember?
I'm her brother.

61
00:04:23,672 --> 00:04:25,713
If we're enemies,
why did you take my side?

62
00:04:26,766 --> 00:04:28,164
Do you really like me?

63
00:04:28,242 --> 00:04:32,326
I felt sorry for you.
You were pathetic, all alone.

64
00:04:32,826 --> 00:04:37,201
You made yourself an outcast,
then kept whining about being alone.

65
00:04:37,338 --> 00:04:39,297
Then keep feeling sorry for me.

66
00:04:40,233 --> 00:04:44,108
I was so happy
when you took my side earlier.

67
00:04:44,691 --> 00:04:46,857
It felt like I finally had a big brother.

68
00:04:49,172 --> 00:04:51,797
Do you know how ridiculous
you look right now?

69
00:04:55,666 --> 00:05:00,500
What's this?

70
00:05:10,732 --> 00:05:12,935
You're so naive.

71
00:05:19,722 --> 00:05:21,222
You're a monster.

72
00:05:24,373 --> 00:05:27,373
Yeong Ju, go home and get some sleep.

73
00:05:27,375 --> 00:05:29,000
I'm waiting to see
if Seung Woo comes home.

74
00:05:30,414 --> 00:05:33,164
Sa Bin, go home.
You're making Se Ri uncomfortable.

75
00:05:33,166 --> 00:05:35,375
How can I leave you here alone?

76
00:05:36,085 --> 00:05:38,460
Then I'll sleep in Seung Woo's room
with Ji Hu.

77
00:05:39,056 --> 00:05:42,931
You should take her home...

78
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:51,875
Yeong Ju, just go home and get some sleep.
I'll wait and see if Seung Woo comes back.

79
00:05:52,974 --> 00:05:55,664
This is my room, anyway.
What's gotten into you?

80
00:05:55,733 --> 00:05:59,067
If your son stormed out like that,
could you really go home and sleep?

81
00:06:37,875 --> 00:06:41,666
Na Se Ri!

82
00:06:47,125 --> 00:06:50,000
- What's this? You thieving bitch.
- Yeong Ju.

83
00:06:50,424 --> 00:06:51,653
Ji Ni knows too, doesn't she?

84
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:55,125
I was wrong to trust you
and your daughter.

85
00:06:55,625 --> 00:06:59,375
- Na Ji Ni!
- Yeong Ju, she doesn't know.

86
00:06:59,416 --> 00:07:03,124
I did it on my own. She's innocent.

87
00:07:03,125 --> 00:07:04,375
Innocent?

88
00:07:38,162 --> 00:07:39,238
Why were you crying?

89
00:07:40,316 --> 00:07:42,362
Ji Hu said he'd punish me.

90
00:07:43,259 --> 00:07:44,691
He said he'd fight me to the end.

91
00:07:45,626 --> 00:07:48,335
Unless I apologize to Na Ji Ni,
he looks ready to do anything.

92
00:07:49,232 --> 00:07:51,941
My parents won't help me.

93
00:07:53,076 --> 00:07:55,117
You know how scary my parents are, right?

94
00:07:55,125 --> 00:07:57,223
I know. I've seen your mom hit you.

95
00:07:58,292 --> 00:08:01,253
- What about your dad?
- He's just as bad.

96
00:08:01,948 --> 00:08:03,120
He hates me.

97
00:08:04,357 --> 00:08:06,543
My dad liked someone else,

98
00:08:07,094 --> 00:08:10,260
but Mom got pregnant with me,
and that's how they got married.

99
00:08:11,432 --> 00:08:13,432
I was what tied Dad down.

100
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:16,876
My mom is his official wife,
but she's always insecure.

101
00:08:18,876 --> 00:08:20,585
What was your dad like?

102
00:08:22,528 --> 00:08:24,528
Right. He's Ji Ni's dad.

103
00:08:25,894 --> 00:08:29,144
Ji Ni's dad was the kind of dad
anyone would envy.

104
00:08:30,653 --> 00:08:32,153
I guess he was.

105
00:08:32,625 --> 00:08:33,625
I see.

106
00:08:34,287 --> 00:08:36,416
So that's why you understand me, right?

107
00:08:43,297 --> 00:08:46,922
If it's someone my mom sent,
tell them I'm not home.

108
00:08:47,019 --> 00:08:48,435
Just somewhere...

109
00:08:48,547 --> 00:08:50,963
I'll handle it. Go to your room.

110
00:09:05,413 --> 00:09:06,454
Come out.

111
00:09:07,191 --> 00:09:10,066
Seung Hyun, look, today...

112
00:09:11,903 --> 00:09:13,481
What's wrong with you?

113
00:09:14,789 --> 00:09:17,414
Do you want me to beat you senseless,
or will you walk out on your own?

114
00:09:17,416 --> 00:09:19,041
It's not what you think.

115
00:09:19,375 --> 00:09:20,999
You and Mom have it all wrong.

116
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,416
What's there to misunderstand?
You're here, aren't you?

117
00:09:24,816 --> 00:09:27,941
Do you feel sorry for her?
She's a criminal.

118
00:09:28,066 --> 00:09:30,982
- I know, but...
- But what?

119
00:09:31,397 --> 00:09:33,414
She's just stupid and clueless.

120
00:09:33,416 --> 00:09:36,166
If she were smart,
would she have made such a mess of things?

121
00:09:36,710 --> 00:09:39,992
Her mom beats her all the time,
and her dad's no dad to her.

122
00:09:40,242 --> 00:09:42,576
She's never known what it's like
to be truly loved...

123
00:09:44,132 --> 00:09:45,539
I was just listening to her
complain about her life.

124
00:09:45,541 --> 00:09:48,000
Seriously, do you like her?

125
00:09:49,097 --> 00:09:50,624
Why would you listen to all that?

126
00:09:50,625 --> 00:09:52,791
I told you, it's not like that.

127
00:09:53,182 --> 00:09:56,223
I didn't like her either.
They say people never change,

128
00:09:58,288 --> 00:09:59,788
but Ji Ni won.

129
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:03,164
So I can at least hear her out.

130
00:10:03,194 --> 00:10:05,819
What's the point of picking on someone
who's already been beaten?

131
00:10:08,325 --> 00:10:10,200
Go. I'll handle it.

132
00:10:10,431 --> 00:10:13,097
I'll listen to her a little longer,
then leave.

133
00:10:13,537 --> 00:10:16,203
If I go, I'll only make things worse.

134
00:10:16,250 --> 00:10:18,000
Don't cross the line. Get this sorted out.

135
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:22,750
Whether it's romance or pity, if there's
one more incident like Han Jeong Won,

136
00:10:23,539 --> 00:10:24,664
I won't let you get away with it.

137
00:10:24,666 --> 00:10:26,666
I was wondering
when you'd bring up Han Jeong Won.

138
00:10:26,857 --> 00:10:30,066
- What?
- Forget it. Go.

139
00:10:33,873 --> 00:10:35,373
Get a grip.

140
00:10:35,645 --> 00:10:38,479
I'm holding myself back right now. Got it?

141
00:11:22,732 --> 00:11:24,857
I shouldn't have gotten involved
with you in the first place.

142
00:11:26,181 --> 00:11:27,972
It was a mistake to do "Love in Zip."

143
00:11:36,297 --> 00:11:37,588
Don't regret it.

144
00:11:38,173 --> 00:11:41,020
My mom says she regrets
giving birth to me,

145
00:11:42,050 --> 00:11:43,798
and even Ji Hu says he regrets it.

146
00:11:44,723 --> 00:11:47,557
Director Cha,
I hope you never regret meeting me.

147
00:11:48,191 --> 00:11:52,607
I wish at least one person
could remember me fondly.

148
00:12:07,250 --> 00:12:08,500
Why are you packing?

149
00:12:08,913 --> 00:12:12,663
I should go home now. The trial went well,
and I don't want to impose.

150
00:12:13,205 --> 00:12:16,289
Impose? This is your home too.

151
00:12:16,338 --> 00:12:18,547
Still, I'll come visit often, Mother.

152
00:12:19,625 --> 00:12:21,666
But I want you to stay.

153
00:12:24,703 --> 00:12:27,912
Mom, why are you acting like a child?

154
00:12:28,098 --> 00:12:30,348
How long will Ji Hu have to stay here
and feel uncomfortable?

155
00:12:31,416 --> 00:12:33,875
Hey, you two. Come sit down.

156
00:12:37,441 --> 00:12:41,857
You two should get married soon.
Then the three of us can move out.

157
00:12:41,992 --> 00:12:45,064
Do you have some money saved?
Can you afford a place with a deposit?

158
00:12:45,065 --> 00:12:46,242
I'll chip in too.

159
00:12:46,291 --> 00:12:47,982
Mom, what are you talking about?

160
00:12:48,124 --> 00:12:49,478
Why would the three of us live together?

161
00:12:50,625 --> 00:12:54,250
Look at you! Are you going to abandon me?

162
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:57,250
Of course not, Mother.
You're alone. We should live together.

163
00:12:57,750 --> 00:13:01,541
See? Ji Hu, you're the only one
I can count on.

164
00:13:02,627 --> 00:13:06,120
Stop talking about this already.
You're making me dizzy.

165
00:13:06,375 --> 00:13:07,791
Slow down a little.

166
00:13:08,625 --> 00:13:09,666
You little brat...

167
00:13:14,375 --> 00:13:15,895
Don't encourage her.

168
00:13:16,058 --> 00:13:17,916
She'll have you completely
under her thumb.

169
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,079
It's only been a short time
since her husband died.

170
00:13:20,376 --> 00:13:21,579
She's just lonely.

171
00:13:22,125 --> 00:13:25,125
And now she's watching my aunt remarry
and find happiness.

172
00:13:25,291 --> 00:13:26,750
She must feel even lonelier.

173
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:32,143
You're holding back
what you want to say, right?

174
00:13:32,686 --> 00:13:33,712
Yes.

175
00:13:33,714 --> 00:13:37,633
My mom is the reason your aunt
has spent her whole life alone.

176
00:13:49,162 --> 00:13:50,162
Mom.

177
00:13:50,875 --> 00:13:52,271
I didn't tell you, but...

178
00:13:53,455 --> 00:13:57,376
Do Hee sprayed me
with a fire extinguisher yesterday.

179
00:13:57,845 --> 00:13:58,845
With a fire extinguisher?

180
00:13:58,847 --> 00:14:01,840
She did it because I found proof
that she'd been lying.

181
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:04,729
Was finding the evidence wrong?

182
00:14:05,325 --> 00:14:07,806
Or was it wrong of her
to ruin someone's life with lies?

183
00:14:07,951 --> 00:14:08,951
Tell me.

184
00:14:10,885 --> 00:14:13,219
- Do Hee was in the wrong.
- Then there's your answer.

185
00:14:14,164 --> 00:14:15,914
Do you know what you need to do or not?

186
00:14:15,916 --> 00:14:19,541
I just took her home
because she looked upset.

187
00:14:20,082 --> 00:14:21,358
Then why didn't you come home?

188
00:14:21,604 --> 00:14:24,854
There were too many people yesterday.
I didn't want to talk in front of them.

189
00:14:26,645 --> 00:14:29,581
I believe you. I will trust you.

190
00:14:31,645 --> 00:14:32,645
Mom.

191
00:14:34,037 --> 00:14:37,348
You're acting this way because of Ji Ni.

192
00:14:37,864 --> 00:14:39,828
Do Hee was engaged to Ji Hu,

193
00:14:40,223 --> 00:14:43,432
but then Ji Hu left her for Ji Ni,
and Do Hee went off the rails.

194
00:14:44,586 --> 00:14:48,375
That's all you know about Do Hee.
There's nothing else, right?

195
00:14:48,416 --> 00:14:50,166
What's your point?

196
00:14:50,250 --> 00:14:54,775
We're seeing Do Hee entirely
from Ji Ni's point of view.

197
00:14:55,125 --> 00:14:57,875
Maybe none of us really knows
what Do Hee is like.

198
00:14:57,916 --> 00:15:00,539
I don't care what's true or false.

199
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:02,166
You shouldn't either.

200
00:15:03,068 --> 00:15:04,277
Okay.

201
00:15:08,278 --> 00:15:09,638
I said okay.

202
00:15:11,375 --> 00:15:13,689
Go on. Get back to your work.

203
00:15:13,900 --> 00:15:16,125
I'll rest a bit, then get back to mine.

204
00:15:43,882 --> 00:15:46,614
Sa Bin went straight to the clinic.

205
00:15:47,835 --> 00:15:50,501
You've been staying out
overnight a lot lately.

206
00:15:51,089 --> 00:15:53,173
I'm sorry.
I've had some things to take care of.

207
00:15:54,207 --> 00:15:57,123
What happened yesterday?
Why was the room such a mess?

208
00:15:57,125 --> 00:15:59,250
The cleaners had a terrible time with it.

209
00:15:59,291 --> 00:16:04,500
Well, Do Hee went berserk and sprayed
a fire extinguisher everywhere.

210
00:16:04,941 --> 00:16:06,816
It's because I took her phone.

211
00:16:07,835 --> 00:16:09,460
She's something else.

212
00:16:09,723 --> 00:16:12,432
What family would want her
as a daughter-in-law?

213
00:16:12,625 --> 00:16:14,125
Why even think about that?

214
00:16:14,482 --> 00:16:15,982
Your luck has finally turned around.

215
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,916
Yes. That's how I should look at it.

216
00:16:28,499 --> 00:16:30,025
Yeong Ju doesn't look well.

217
00:16:30,159 --> 00:16:32,373
She seemed fine
right after the trial yesterday.

218
00:16:32,375 --> 00:16:34,375
You've got bigger things
to worry about right now.

219
00:16:34,875 --> 00:16:37,916
Honey, what if Ji Ni and her mom...

220
00:16:38,242 --> 00:16:41,242
are holding Ji Hu hostage
and won't let him come home...

221
00:16:41,375 --> 00:16:42,625
until he has no choice but to marry her?

222
00:16:42,666 --> 00:16:43,791
They're not that kind of people.

223
00:16:43,845 --> 00:16:45,500
You just don't know them.

224
00:16:45,867 --> 00:16:48,867
I saw her mom making him
give her a foot massage yesterday.

225
00:16:48,932 --> 00:16:51,473
I'm lucky my blood pressure didn't spike.

226
00:16:51,582 --> 00:16:54,748
We need to arrange a proper meeting
and formally introduce ourselves.

227
00:16:54,826 --> 00:16:57,451
- Introduce ourselves?
- We should be polite, especially now.

228
00:16:58,002 --> 00:16:59,961
Otherwise, he'll really become
someone else's son-in-law.

229
00:17:31,125 --> 00:17:32,250
Ji Ni.

230
00:17:44,017 --> 00:17:45,118
Let's go.

231
00:17:49,432 --> 00:17:51,598
My pretty princess, here's your coffee.

232
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:53,291
Thank you.

233
00:17:53,672 --> 00:17:56,547
I'm the one who's touched.
You look beautiful.

234
00:17:56,625 --> 00:17:59,962
What? You like this kind of look?

235
00:18:00,451 --> 00:18:02,326
I like everything about you, Ji Ni.

236
00:18:02,750 --> 00:18:04,875
I've never seen you check yourself out
in the mirror so much.

237
00:18:05,791 --> 00:18:09,541
I keep getting distracted by you.
What if I get into an accident?

238
00:18:09,930 --> 00:18:13,091
Stop it. I'm not used
to being complimented like this.

239
00:18:13,196 --> 00:18:14,415
It's so awkward.

240
00:18:14,417 --> 00:18:15,836
So you're not used to it?

241
00:18:16,465 --> 00:18:18,000
Then I'll do it more often.

242
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:20,085
You'll get used to hearing compliments.

243
00:18:20,162 --> 00:18:23,662
You're such a natural flirt.
I'm the only rookie here.

244
00:18:24,681 --> 00:18:25,681
Let's get going.

245
00:18:35,591 --> 00:18:37,362
- There it is.
- Yes.

246
00:18:39,443 --> 00:18:41,443
- Can I prop it up a little?
- Of course.

247
00:18:42,416 --> 00:18:43,916
(The Law of Fangs)

248
00:18:44,625 --> 00:18:46,125
(Amu's Shop)

249
00:18:46,250 --> 00:18:47,250
How's the response been?

250
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:49,539
A lot of people have been asking about it,

251
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:51,625
and many inquiries are turning into sales.

252
00:18:53,915 --> 00:18:58,930
If you're not seeing anyone,
could I get your number?

253
00:19:00,125 --> 00:19:01,500
I have a girlfriend.

254
00:19:01,672 --> 00:19:03,797
- I'm sorry.
- No, it's okay.

255
00:19:04,357 --> 00:19:05,443
I'll leave it in your hands.

256
00:19:09,539 --> 00:19:12,539
Why are you smiling? That didn't seem
to be about the books anymore.

257
00:19:12,617 --> 00:19:13,826
How did you know?

258
00:19:13,916 --> 00:19:14,999
Just a feeling.

259
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,791
That's scary. Women really...

260
00:19:18,500 --> 00:19:20,750
You're right. She asked for my number.

261
00:19:21,844 --> 00:19:24,250
- And what did you say?
- I told her I had a girlfriend.

262
00:19:26,306 --> 00:19:28,931
I hope next time I can say I'm married.

263
00:19:30,242 --> 00:19:32,025
Just thinking out loud.

264
00:19:32,450 --> 00:19:35,741
Saying we're married feels more official
than saying you're my girlfriend.

265
00:19:44,922 --> 00:19:46,172
Jung A.

266
00:19:46,598 --> 00:19:48,603
What's wrong?

267
00:19:49,625 --> 00:19:51,250
My heart won't stop pounding.

268
00:19:52,191 --> 00:19:55,743
I clenched my teeth so I wouldn't show it,
and now my jaw hurts.

269
00:19:55,937 --> 00:19:56,937
Were you like that too?

270
00:19:57,291 --> 00:19:58,500
Are you that happy?

271
00:19:59,816 --> 00:20:01,941
But Ji Hu doesn't seem nervous at all.

272
00:20:02,588 --> 00:20:05,297
He's so smooth with his words
and so natural with affection.

273
00:20:06,250 --> 00:20:08,251
Ji Hu's an old pro, after all.

274
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:11,541
We're total beginners. Complete newbies.

275
00:20:14,326 --> 00:20:17,451
I saw someone ask for his number
again today.

276
00:20:18,201 --> 00:20:19,992
He said no because he has a girlfriend.

277
00:20:20,338 --> 00:20:23,922
But he said he'd prefer
to tell people he's married.

278
00:20:24,038 --> 00:20:26,288
He's experienced, isn't he?
It comes so naturally.

279
00:20:26,412 --> 00:20:28,537
He says things like that so casually.

280
00:20:29,461 --> 00:20:32,284
Poor baby Ji Ni has so much to deal with.

281
00:20:32,628 --> 00:20:33,961
Still, I envy you.

282
00:20:35,059 --> 00:20:37,145
Drawing seems easier than this.

283
00:20:37,356 --> 00:20:39,125
There's too much to worry about.

284
00:20:49,625 --> 00:20:50,750
Mother.

285
00:20:52,441 --> 00:20:53,654
Good, you're here.

286
00:20:54,751 --> 00:20:55,982
So you work here?

287
00:20:56,416 --> 00:20:57,500
Yes.

288
00:20:58,367 --> 00:20:59,576
Hello.

289
00:20:59,916 --> 00:21:01,749
Hello. Is this the friend you work with?

290
00:21:01,750 --> 00:21:02,791
Yes.

291
00:21:03,482 --> 00:21:06,982
You're the one who brought Ji Hu home
when he was drunk...

292
00:21:07,819 --> 00:21:09,264
Yes. You remember me.

293
00:21:10,625 --> 00:21:12,377
- I'll bring some coffee.
- Okay.

294
00:21:22,329 --> 00:21:24,954
I'm sorry for how I've treated you.

295
00:21:26,616 --> 00:21:28,491
I hurt you a lot, didn't I?

296
00:21:30,232 --> 00:21:33,472
I suppose I was too protective of Ji Hu.

297
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:35,451
Please try to understand.

298
00:21:36,528 --> 00:21:38,803
I do. It's okay.

299
00:21:40,047 --> 00:21:43,797
I'm so scared
that Ji Hu and I will drift apart.

300
00:21:44,625 --> 00:21:49,250
When Ji Hu was a child,
I didn't show him enough love.

301
00:21:51,056 --> 00:21:52,847
I have so many regrets.

302
00:21:54,412 --> 00:21:56,037
Do you understand how I feel?

303
00:21:56,316 --> 00:22:00,482
Of course. He thinks about you a lot.

304
00:22:01,322 --> 00:22:03,944
He said he's going home today.
Don't worry.

305
00:22:04,125 --> 00:22:07,750
Really? That's a relief.

306
00:22:12,608 --> 00:22:16,858
You two have been through so much.

307
00:22:19,306 --> 00:22:22,681
Give yourselves time to date
and consider things carefully.

308
00:22:22,876 --> 00:22:25,585
I don't want to rush things anymore.

309
00:22:26,605 --> 00:22:27,646
Okay.

310
00:22:31,576 --> 00:22:32,576
Have some coffee.

311
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:36,375
- Here you are.
- Thank you.

312
00:22:40,787 --> 00:22:43,662
I didn't get to thank you properly then.

313
00:22:45,394 --> 00:22:46,394
What's your name?

314
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:48,375
I'm Jeon Jung A.

315
00:22:49,060 --> 00:22:52,318
I'm Ji Ni's friend.
I used to see Ji Hu often too.

316
00:22:52,538 --> 00:22:53,769
And Tae O too.

317
00:22:54,347 --> 00:22:56,874
I saw you at the hospital too
when Ji Hu was ill.

318
00:22:57,416 --> 00:22:58,957
I see.

319
00:22:59,191 --> 00:23:00,732
You have such a gentle face.

320
00:23:01,625 --> 00:23:02,666
What do your parents do?

321
00:23:02,750 --> 00:23:04,117
They're both government employees.

322
00:23:05,041 --> 00:23:07,000
That explains your good manners.

323
00:23:08,816 --> 00:23:10,857
I'm glad your family background is simple.

324
00:23:11,104 --> 00:23:14,104
It's always best to be ordinary.

325
00:23:16,413 --> 00:23:18,663
Come visit us sometime.

326
00:23:18,666 --> 00:23:20,291
Keep in touch with Ji Hu too.

327
00:23:24,098 --> 00:23:25,182
See you again.

328
00:23:25,250 --> 00:23:26,250
Okay.

329
00:23:29,441 --> 00:23:31,107
Thanks for the coffee.

330
00:23:32,316 --> 00:23:34,441
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.

331
00:23:39,166 --> 00:23:41,041
What's gotten into her?

332
00:23:41,432 --> 00:23:44,055
Last time, she was glaring at me,

333
00:23:44,162 --> 00:23:46,182
but now her eyes are full of affection.

334
00:23:46,250 --> 00:23:47,791
It's making me uncomfortable.

335
00:23:51,335 --> 00:23:53,460
What is it? What's wrong?

336
00:23:55,182 --> 00:23:56,307
It's just...

337
00:23:58,779 --> 00:24:01,249
I don't think his mom likes me.

338
00:24:01,325 --> 00:24:04,491
So what? You're not getting married yet.

339
00:24:05,125 --> 00:24:07,150
Give it time and visit her.

340
00:24:07,598 --> 00:24:10,307
Ji Hu's sure about you. Why worry?

341
00:24:10,982 --> 00:24:14,107
Would things improve if we got married?

342
00:24:15,791 --> 00:24:16,875
Na Ji Ni.

343
00:24:17,432 --> 00:24:20,201
My mom wants us to get married.
Ji Hu does too...

344
00:24:21,228 --> 00:24:24,099
If I keep hesitating like this,

345
00:24:24,100 --> 00:24:26,500
I'm scared I'll end up in a mess again.

346
00:24:36,500 --> 00:24:40,416
Nice. Do a V sign. Now, angle your chin.

347
00:24:41,166 --> 00:24:42,916
I can't tell which one's the real jewel.

348
00:24:43,125 --> 00:24:46,250
That's gorgeous. Show the earrings now.

349
00:24:46,791 --> 00:24:49,291
Great. That's wonderful.

350
00:24:52,955 --> 00:24:56,039
I thought modeling jewelry would be easy,
but it's even harder.

351
00:24:56,041 --> 00:24:58,875
You're hot, right?
Jewelry shoots need strong lighting.

352
00:24:59,291 --> 00:25:00,375
Where's the jewelry?

353
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,916
They took it all back after the shoot.

354
00:25:03,125 --> 00:25:04,375
Which did you like best?

355
00:25:04,957 --> 00:25:07,624
The pearls. They suit older women.

356
00:25:07,625 --> 00:25:10,125
I expect pearls will be the main sellers.

357
00:25:11,787 --> 00:25:15,953
By the way,
do you know a good gold dealer?

358
00:25:16,163 --> 00:25:19,204
Gold? I don't even have a ring
from my first birthday.

359
00:25:20,829 --> 00:25:22,204
Why? Are you selling gold?

360
00:25:22,482 --> 00:25:26,316
Ji Ni may be getting married soon.
I should start preparing.

361
00:25:26,854 --> 00:25:29,818
I have good news.
You might not have to sell any gold.

362
00:25:30,998 --> 00:25:32,623
There's an offer to advertise a game.

363
00:25:32,625 --> 00:25:34,541
A game advertisement?

364
00:25:34,658 --> 00:25:36,875
How would I advertise a game?

365
00:25:36,916 --> 00:25:39,726
It's more than filming one commercial.

366
00:25:40,176 --> 00:25:41,875
They keep building on the story.

367
00:25:41,916 --> 00:25:46,166
That's why the signing fee is so high.
If the game lasts, you could keep earning.

368
00:25:46,541 --> 00:25:49,000
Not every model gets an offer like this.

369
00:25:49,791 --> 00:25:50,875
I'm in, no matter what.

370
00:25:51,041 --> 00:25:52,750
Definitely. You have to do it.

371
00:25:55,625 --> 00:25:56,625
It's so hot.

372
00:26:02,422 --> 00:26:05,172
Can we talk for a moment?

373
00:26:17,038 --> 00:26:18,494
Would you...

374
00:26:19,410 --> 00:26:22,630
consider letting Do Hee go to England?

375
00:26:23,123 --> 00:26:24,164
What?

376
00:26:24,625 --> 00:26:30,625
Ji Hu told Do Hee he'd drop his complaint
if you forgave her.

377
00:26:32,712 --> 00:26:34,684
So she asked you to speak to me for her?

378
00:26:37,913 --> 00:26:39,579
She's already falling apart.

379
00:26:40,210 --> 00:26:43,335
You can't back someone into a corner
without giving them a way out.

380
00:26:43,836 --> 00:26:46,711
- Ji Ni, could you talk to Ji Hu...
- Wherever...

381
00:26:47,213 --> 00:26:49,463
she saw me, alone or around others,

382
00:26:49,607 --> 00:26:53,243
she'd shame me as a mistress's daughter.
She even tried to kill me.

383
00:26:54,078 --> 00:26:57,135
I gave up on school
and tried to kill myself.

384
00:26:58,886 --> 00:27:01,470
- I know, but...
- No.

385
00:27:02,257 --> 00:27:03,673
You don't seem to understand.

386
00:27:06,307 --> 00:27:09,848
Once, high school boys surrounded me
in a storage room.

387
00:27:11,029 --> 00:27:15,356
I don't know what might've happened
if Dad hadn't shown up.

388
00:27:20,086 --> 00:27:24,336
If I meant anything to you as a sister,

389
00:27:25,682 --> 00:27:27,307
you wouldn't have asked me this.

390
00:27:27,393 --> 00:27:30,184
No. You couldn't have.

391
00:27:32,219 --> 00:27:36,209
And this time, Ji Hu was the one
she wronged.

392
00:27:36,324 --> 00:27:37,619
I have no right to decide.

393
00:27:38,250 --> 00:27:43,291
At least Dad was there to save you.

394
00:27:44,979 --> 00:27:45,979
What?

395
00:27:46,041 --> 00:27:50,291
- When I had my accident, he...
- Why bring that up now...

396
00:27:53,492 --> 00:27:57,826
Ji Ni, let's talk.

397
00:28:31,541 --> 00:28:34,874
(Family Register)

398
00:28:34,875 --> 00:28:35,904
Reporting when I come and go?

399
00:28:35,906 --> 00:28:38,374
Ji Ni's mom makes you report
when you get to work and leave?

400
00:28:38,375 --> 00:28:40,624
Why should you report to her?

401
00:28:40,625 --> 00:28:41,874
Mom, keep this up and I'll break up.

402
00:28:41,875 --> 00:28:43,374
Can you love without being possessive?

403
00:28:43,375 --> 00:28:45,666
Are you my wife? Why are you watching me?

404
00:28:45,750 --> 00:28:47,125
What's your relationship with Do Hee?

405
00:28:47,166 --> 00:28:48,249
You're not dating, are you?

406
00:28:48,250 --> 00:28:51,499
The case was closed.
If you happen to see my son,

407
00:28:51,500 --> 00:28:55,250
I don't want you bringing up Pumseongak
or anything like that.

408
00:28:56,171 --> 00:28:58,171
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
